#: build/Plugins/git/gitui.cpp:556
msgid ""
"Optional extra arguments that you wish passed to git log.\n"
"\n"
"An example might be:\n"
"--since=\"2 weeks ago\"\n"
"\n"
"Note that this is _not_ sanity-checked, it's added just as it is"
